Subject: [PATCH] feat(20-03): implement bounded memory and exact-origin guides

- Persist strict caller-filtered memory and guide records with opaque IDs
- Enforce Unicode search, fixed limits, deterministic LRU, and restart repair
- Revalidate exact committed-document origins and retain safe apply metadata
